<title>UK: UK'a Major says economy better than Europe.</title>
<headline>UK'a Major says economy better than Europe.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>British Prime Minister John Major said on Sunday that the British economy was performing better than anywhere else in Europe and prospects for the future are very good.</p>
<p>In an interview with Sir David frost on BBC television, he said the European Union must be more flexible and the size of the EU commission must be cut.</p>
</text>
